[Cheats\Enable Debug Mode opens two extra options in OPTIONS menu while in-game. The CHEATS menu doesn't work. GUN opens a level select menu and a cutscene viewer.While the code is active, press R3+D-Pad Up to enable it, and R3+D-Pad Down to disable it. Make sure you only enable it some time after the opening logos]
